# .NET build output for the WebView2 host.
#
# host/bin/Release/net8.0-windows IS tracked, exactly like lib/: a github:
# install fetches the repository tree, so a gitignored host binary would leave
# the plugin unable to start its browser window. The csproj trims what the
# WebView2 package over-ships (the WPF assembly and the duplicate native
# loader), so what is committed is only what the host actually loads.
# Intermediate output and self-contained publishes are not tracked.
host/obj/
host/publish/
host/bin/Debug/
